Scoped maskedclamp video filter

The option table, eight-bit pix_fmts subset, three-input size check, clamp
order, plane mask and plane copy semantics in src/video-ops/maskedclamp.ts
follow libavfilter/vf_maskedclamp.c (maskedclamp_options, pix_fmts,
maskedclamp8, maskedclamp_slice, process_frame, config_input, config_output).
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
